/v1/","context":{"app_id":3727600,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3727600-1846651706685954","game_id":"steam-3727600","kind":"announcement","title":"ALL THE PROMISED BURN will release...","summary":"What an absolute AVALANCHE of an autumn it's been.As some of you know from following my YouTube channel, I moved back across the country unexpectedly and have lost my expected funding source -- which really put a damper on my \"Full Time Game Dev\" dreams. Uhhhh, so anyway, I moved. And I got really lucky and I acquired a place to live really fast!...And then my rabbit got a liver lobe torsion and almost died. So I spent a week nursing my poor, baby boy back to health and somehow, miraculously, he","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T01:54:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685954","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727600-1839041357031010","game_id":"steam-3727600","kind":"announcement","title":"July Devlogs & Diversions","summary":"My dearest friends and detested enemies, I am still alive. Of my 38 letters in Season 1, I have implemented 10. I also added a chase sequence to when the enemies take over your house, so that's pretty fun. I also made No AI stamps for all my store pages and sooooo so much art. I am on schedule now, but the Move Back TM threatens to press wrinkles into the best laid plans of mice and men. *shrugs* What can you do? So it goes.I also designed, wrote, and did art for the Toasty Time Game Jam -- and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-25T00:10:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357031010","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727600-1836506165544755","game_id":"steam-3727600","kind":"announcement","title":"Our June Devlog","summary":"\"Amaiguri, what have you been DOING since you finished your script?\"Good question: VACATIONING! 🧉😎🛌🏻I was visiting friends and family, getting Wedding photos taken, visiting fancy restaurants, etc.And while I was vacationing, I also:Added my first letter to the gamePlanned out the rest of the year of marketing and videosLined up a new YouTube collaborationWritten 3 other videosAND made a production schedule through the end of SummerNow, SUMMER is 53 Workdays, 78 Calendar Days from June 14th to A","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T03:28:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165544755","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727600-1833334318570900","game_id":"steam-3727600","kind":"announcement","title":"Locked-In: The Script is DONE!","summary":"To all my dearest Parasocialites,I have the most excellent news: The story of ALL THE PROMISED BURN has been outlined, written, playtested, and edited. It is done. It is such a huge weight off my back. I am so pleased with how I've tuned it here, at the end. And if I were to suddenly die now, you could still understand the vision -- you could have the script, most of the art, the gameplay... why, you could even ASSEMBLE it without me! I could even RELEASE the game episodically into Early Access.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-22T07:16:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318570900","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3727600-1823825466506301","game_id":"steam-3727600","kind":"announcement","title":"All the Promised Burn is OFFICIALLY in Development!","summary":"How's it going?My friends and parasocial darlings, All the Promised Burn -- my hand-drawn knowledge-based RPG -- is officially in development! Please be excited to translate (fictional) dead languages into living ones, try cooking real recipes with fake food, and cry at the growing distance between you and the people you've left behind. There will be screaming into the void AND big fluffy cats to hug. It'll be a wondrous time. Woot woot!What even IS a \"Knowledge-based\" RPG?It's when you go aroun","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-09T18:17:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466506301","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3727600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:50Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:49Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3727600":"2026-10-26T00:44:50Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3727600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5233300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:50Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3727600","app_id":3727600,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:21Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"24e6c6e6cf2df2de9fe170136f4de67b25c02ef9db65a648d1f630941c090d06","response_sha25